want to just ignore and have then keep individual mechanics, nothing changes.<br /> <br /> 5- Precisely because it doesn't change lore, they all got loresheets meant to help you keep each line perfectly distinct inside the Hecata. It works in all aspects more as a sect than a clan despite unified core Weakness/Spread.<br /> <br /> 6- No origin story was altered. Everyone assumed the Samedi as descended from Cappadocians, no questions asked, so they may not be, and everyone knows the Nagaraja aren't related to them, but no one gives a damn. It is just a defensive pact sealed with a ritual.<br /> <br /> 7- No one knows what to do with the Promise, but in theory it doesn't affect the non-Giovanni bloodlines anyway.<br /> <br /> 8- How much actual power the Capuchin have over the others or how united they are is up in the air.</div> </div> </div> </div>You make mention of a ritual. I read the book, but don't remember that part. Where is it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T20:40:47-07:00","id":1466391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466122-v5-clan-giovanni?p=1466383#post1466383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"mes